{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6d05309737113ae6","name":"Recording Unit","source":{"id":"source:reference-6d05309737113ae6","title":"Recording Unit","revision":18446,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:08:38Z","sha256":"b9f5841222294856f91aa966328cf01406033381d648aa3c47db9b5079818468","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18446","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Recording%20Unit&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6d05309737113ae6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RECORDING UNIT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["WEIGHT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Audiorecorder\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0.1 Kilograms\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Videorecorder\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["50\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0.1 Kilograms\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Holorecorder\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["100\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0.1 Kilograms\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["This storage device is an Audio-, Video-, or Holo-recorder with a playback feature. It has an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," score of 1, and 1 memory unit. You can modify a recording (edit, erase, or rearrange the order of events) with a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check. However, anyone can make an opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check (if observing the recording), or opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check (if inspecting the data from the recording) to detect any modifications you have made. Editing or modifying a recording without first uploading it to a computer can be difficult: add the recording unit's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," modifier (-5) to any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," checks you make to change the recording.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Audiorecorder:"]}," An Audiorecorder stores 100 hours of high-quality Audio.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Videorecorder:"]}," A Videorecorder stores 10 hours of high-quality Video.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Holorecorder:"]}," A Holorecorder stores 1 hour of high-quality Holos.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
